      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can assist you in drafting a press release that balances professionalism with empathy while maintaining legal caution regarding liability. However, I cannot actually \"hear\" or process the sentiment analysis output of external tools, so I cannot calculate the specific score for you. Instead, I have drafted a below text aiming for a balanced tone that acknowledges the severity of the issue and outlines immediate steps without explicitly admitting fault.\n\n**FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE**\n**[Airline Name]** Addresses Recent Baggage Disruptions with Commitment to Passenger Safety and Recovery\n\n*[City, Date]* – [Airline Name] is deeply concerned regarding the recent reports of missing luggage and the frustration felt by our valued customers during this challenging period. We recognize the impact of this issue on travelers and are dedicated to providing zero-tolerance accountability while we conduct a thorough, independent investigation into the cause.\n\nTo restore trust, we are immediately opening a claim process for affected passengers and deploying specialized teams to locate and deliver each unaccounted bag with expedited care. While we are currently reviewing internal operational data, we remain fully committed to resolving these matters efficiently and holding our staff accountable to the highest standards. For detailed updates and assistance, please visit our dedicated customer service portal.",
